    "h": "The Claims Specialist Tasks",
    "html": "<div class=\"cs cs-pages\"><figure class=\"cs-page\" data-say=\"The Claims Specialist Tasks\nOne of the critical responsibilities of a Claims\nSpecialist is determining what insurance coverage is available for the client. This includes identifying the liable party’s insurance and reviewing any available policies that could provide compensation for damages.\nDetermination of\nDeterminationof\nCoverages\n🔍 Identify All Involved Policies:\nIdentifyAllInvolvedPolicies:\n3P (3rd PARTY) - Bodily Injury Coverage- Driver’s Insurance\n3P (3rd PARTY) - Bodily Injury Coverage- Vehicle Owner’s Insurance\n1P(1st PARTY) - UM/UIM Coverage- Client’s Insurance\n1P(1st PARTY) - UM/UIM Coverage-Client’s Resident Relative Insurance\n1P(1st PARTY) - PIP Coverage- Client’s  Insurance\nAny third-party policies (e.g., commercial policies, permissive use situations)\nPresentation\"><img src=\"/ft/csr/slides/005.webp\" alt=\"Determination of Determination of Coverages Coverages Determination of Coverages THE CLAIMS THE CLAIMS SPECIALIST TASKS SPECIALIST TASKS THE CLAIMS SPECIALIST TASKS One of the critical responsibilities of a Claims Specialist is determining what insurance coverage is available for the client. This includes identifying the liable party’s insurance and reviewing any available policies that could provide compensation for damages. 🔍 Identify All Involved Policies: Identify All Involved Policies: 🔍 Identify All Involved Policies: 3P (3rd PARTY) - Bodily Injury Coverage- Driver’s Insurance 3P (3rd PARTY) - Bodily Injury Coverage- Vehicle Owner’s Insurance 1P(1st PARTY) - UM/UIM Coverage- Client’s Insurance 1P(1st PARTY) - UM/UIM Coverage-Client’s Resident Relative Insurance 1P(1st PARTY) - PIP Coverage- Client’s Insurance Any third-party policies (e.g., commercial policies, permissive use situa\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div>"
